@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant "Flutter Client" as Client
participant "Storage Bucket" as Storage
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Job Queue" as Queue
participant "Analysis Worker" as Worker

== Video Upload Flow ==

User -> Client: Select/Record Video
activate Client
Client -> Client: Validate Video\n(max 20s, 100MB)

User -> Client: Add Timestamps & Metadata\n(email, dance_style, trim_start/end)
Client -> Client: Prepare multipart request\n(video + metadata + timestamps)

Client -> Storage: Upload video file
activate Storage
Storage --> Client: Return storage URL/reference
deactivate Storage

Client -> API: POST /analyze\n(metadata + storage reference)
activate API
note right of API
  Request fields:
  - email
  - dance_style
  - trim_start_seconds
  - trim_end_seconds
  - timestamps (JSON array)
  - video_reference (storage URL)
end note

API -> API: Validate request
API -> Queue: Enqueue analysis job\n(video_reference + metadata)
activate Queue
API --> Client: 200 OK\n{"video_reference": "..."}
deactivate API
note left of Client
  Client stores reference ID
  for tracking upload
end note

Client -> Client: Update UI state\n(show upload success)
deactivate Client

== Background Processing ==

Queue -> Worker: Dispatch job
activate Worker
Worker -> Storage: Fetch video via reference
activate Storage
Storage --> Worker: Stream video data
deactivate Storage

Worker -> Worker: Extract video frames
Worker -> Worker: Run pose estimation\n(generate keypoints per frame)

Worker -> Worker: Analyze poses\n(compare against dance style)

Worker -> Worker: Generate feedback items\n(timestamped corrections)

Worker -> API: Store results in database
activate API
API -> API: Save analysis result\n(feedback_items + pose_data)
deactivate API

Worker -> Queue: Mark job complete
deactivate Worker
deactivate Queue

== Results Retrieval ==

Client -> API: GET /results/{video_reference}\nor poll /status/{video_reference}
activate Client
activate API
API --> Client: 200 OK\n{"feedback_items": [...], "pose_data": [...]}
deactivate API

Client -> Client: Deserialize JSON to models\n(FeedbackItem, PoseData)

Client -> Client: Display results page\n(video player + pose overlay)

Client -> User: Show feedback with\npose visualization
deactivate Client

@enduml
